      402.01,
      539.95,
      446.08
    ],
    "text": "THE Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka (\u201cthe Commission\u201d) hereby gives notice pursuant to Section 20(2) of theSri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009 that the Commission intends to revoke the electricity generation licensesgranted to below identified entities in order to generate electricity, due to the amalgamation of those entities with WKVHydro Technics (Pvt) Ltd with effect from 30th March 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
